WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The DNSChat tutorial in 75 seconds.

00:05.000 --> 00:14.000
DNS is observable. Never send secrets or personal data.

00:14.000 --> 00:25.000
Open a conversation and write a short question. [Click and typing sounds]

00:25.000 --> 00:37.000
Send the message; transport status and the TXT response appear on screen. [Click and confirmation tone]

00:37.000 --> 00:50.000
Logs show transport, status, and timing without exposing conversation text.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
Choose an approved DNS service, theme, and language. [Click]

01:00.000 --> 01:09.000
Encrypted history stays local and can be deleted.

01:09.000 --> 01:15.000
Short questions, visible transport, and local history. [Confirmation tone]
